  "metaRegistry": "https://w3id.org/ogc/bblocks/meta-register.json",
  "name": "Building Blocks - OGC Building Blocks Deep Dive",
  "abstract": "Exercise register for the OGC Building Blocks deep-dive video series: a water body survey\nobservation with a custom result and a provenance trace.\n",
  "description": "Built step by step in the Hands-on videos of the series. Each video has a `<slug>-task` tag\n(starting point) and a `<slug>-solved` tag (end state).\n",
